url: >-
  https://mpaivama.github.io/accelerometer-visualisation-decision-support/
abstract: >-
  An open-source toolkit supporting transparent and reproducible visualisation
  decision-making for accelerometer-based 24/7 movement behaviour data. It
  includes a rule-based decision tree, guided web interface, visualisation
  checklist, report generator, structural-audit code, reusable plotting code,
  an application to a published NHANES study, simulated visualisation examples, documentation,
  and tests.
